.SS "Minor Changes"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Add support for \fRapplication/json\fP and \fRtext/plain\fP encodings for \fRuseSubmit\fP/\fRfetcher\&.submit\fP\&. To reflect these additional types, \fRuseNavigation\fP/\fRuseFetcher\fP now also contain \fRnavigation\&.json\fP/\fRnavigation\&.text\fP and \fRfetcher\&.json\fP/\fRfetcher\&.text\fP which include the json/text submission if applicable (\fR#10413\fP)

